<title>USA: Greenleaf ends Hollywood Trenz deal.</title>
<headline>Greenleaf ends Hollywood Trenz deal.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenleaf Capital Corp said on Wednesday that it has advised Hollywood Trenz Inc that it has agreed to mutually terminate all business arrangements between the two companies.</p>
<p>Greenleaf said it is actively pursuing other opportuniies or businesses it can acquire in the entertainment or media industries.</p>
</text>
